{"product_id":"life-on-a-knifes-edge","title":"Life on a Knife's Edge","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen Dr Rahul Jandial operated on Karina, an eleven-year-old girl whose spinal cord was splitting in two, he had to make an impossible decision. He followed his head over his gut and Karina was left permanently paralysed, altering both patient and surgeon's lives for ever. This decision would haunt Rahul for decades, a constant reminder of the fine line between saving and damaging a life.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eAs one of the world's leading brain surgeons, Rahul is the last hope for patients with extreme forms of cancer. In treating them, he has observed humanity at its most raw and most robust. He has journeyed to unimaginable extremes with them, guiding them through the darkest moments of their lives.\u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:16 x 234  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Rahul Jandial \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780241461839 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 224\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43603345604761,"sku":"15RA-1-9780241461839","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/LifeonaKnife_sEdge.jpg?v=1702713637","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/life-on-a-knifes-edge","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}